  "narration_lines": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "凭着山神印的感应，林大壮又在山里找到一块罕见的云纹茯苓。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/heldout_episode_7_8/candidate_v1/narration_01.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 0.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.925,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "checksum": "sha256:da93a5c381db1acda8e63c793436a57a5695a78544561efc90022881463a7c23",
      "cache_key": "sha256:0de4d6077f47bdf4bf1dd8098c09bd533fbd4eb1667a9de6679bbd1a013599f2",
      "cache_hit": false,
      "line_id": "da29dc78-f5fc-519c-892e-10189f8f68a8",
      "anchor_source": "tool",
      "required_event_ids": [
        "rare-poria-found"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "连识货的老人都没见过这么完整的品相。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/heldout_episode_7_8/candidate_v1/narration_02.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 8.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.347,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "checksum": "sha256:64bd74b77e13b192189d01bd0768e49c760ea4c9e294d15e3513b0e1e5b30f87",
      "cache_key": "sha256:5c218104ba2841141f64cca4e927461394959b78db7ac12d79c40bcd322516d0",
      "cache_hit": false,
      "line_id": "e42e5af0-9138-5f75-8f1d-35bd29fa6449",
      "anchor_source": "tool",
      "required_event_ids": [
        "appraiser-confirms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "消息一传开，市场上的人立刻抢着出价。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/heldout_episode_7_8/candidate_v1/narration_03.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 12.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.688,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "checksum": "sha256:bdc3233c8bc3f526aa769728ce64b6f37841b0501bfdca52df784bd603a732b8",
      "cache_key": "sha256:3036d1108377c6f27a9198e4b29e911ddc9c9f0409404a16e9ce6f352bd40486",
      "cache_hit": false,
      "line_id": "f2dbd0c2-5b2f-58a8-942e-8bd1b9faf266",
      "anchor_source": "tool",
      "required_event_ids": [
        "crowd-bids"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "争得最凶的时候，之前买参的女人再次赶到。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/heldout_episode_7_8/candidate_v1/narration_04.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 16.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.859,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "checksum": "sha256:7598a03e17ce140c01628607994bfa3f0bc2663e3470950a478956c8fcc5f09d",
      "cache_key": "sha256:19f640cdaa80d7cd80c84d983d6a9e5f5a6f3a84eda69f3dac72bf764ca23da1",
      "cache_hit": false,
      "line_id": "8b57fbb0-92b3-5ec2-908d-474ef57aad38",
      "anchor_source": "tool",
      "required_event_ids": [
        "buyer-arrives"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "等三十万的报价说完，两样药材当场成交。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/heldout_episode_7_8/candidate_v1/narration_05.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 28.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.859,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 8.0,
      "checksum": "sha256:1a58d41fd1ad55e3188e3ec5603144360778800d5727de03faae1d4ab4011de6",
      "cache_key": "sha256:0c578910aad93f9a0917501fcad00ce1f0c4fcbb6d5258693d7e738dc2394f28",
      "cache_hit": false,
      "line_id": "1a8f043f-fc2e-5a2e-9ed3-830d5b83a87f",
      "anchor_source": "tool",
      "required_event_ids": [
        "thirty-wan-offer",
        "deal-completes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "可这笔钱刚到账，就被一直盯着他的仇家知道了。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/heldout_episode_7_8/candidate_v1/narration_06.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 32.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.944,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "checksum": "sha256:2defa1e2d449e0f94c95a5de34c164066d46ca103ff9fc154f4e341280bddc48",
      "cache_key": "sha256:0480dedecb6bade4ceecc5a36402606061537d5d4321f0c26a22ea2dff303bae",
      "cache_hit": false,
      "line_id": "c4374645-9d77-505a-9d52-1a0cc6de3d9c",
      "anchor_source": "tool",
      "required_event_ids": [
        "enemy-learns-income"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "上一次没能除掉他，这一次，对方直接下了死手。",
      "path": "/Users/chinglam/workspace/NarratoProV1/outputs/heldout_episode_7_8/candidate_v1/narration_07.wav",
      "timeline_start_seconds": 36.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.328,
      "slot_duration_seconds": 3.8,
